# Title: low user can prevent owner from some features

## **Summary:**

low privilege user(user) who by default don't have access to any feature (chat or contact or etc) can access chat with owner privilege and delete the original owner

## **Steps To Reproduce:**

1. go to https://info.wavelo.com
2. register with A and B
3. invite B(Attacker) to A(victim) and don't give him access to anything
4. notice that B can't go to chats but when change subdomain to chat.wavelo.com
5. notice that B access chats and the worst that his role is Owner , too => that's bug because ORG shouldn't have 2 Owners.

---

1. delete the original owner (A) or change his role to user to prevent him from access chat feature that lead to take over chat feature with the least privilege.

